     3061                              , input buf_temp_pr-doc-num.doc-num
     3062                              , input v-today
     3063                              ).
     3064       end.
     3065       for each buf_temp_del-doc-code
     3066       on error undo, return error
     3067       :
     3068           run bge/setbgedt.p (
     3069                 input 'c-trn-doc':U
     3070               , input buf_temp_del-doc-code.doc-code
     3071               , input v-today
     3072           ).
